        "code": {
          "text": "Low back pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Ongoing for approximately 3 months, more noticeable over 4–6 weeks and worsening over the last month or so. Central/paraspinal lumbar ache with deep stiffness; worse with standing and walking, better with sitting and stretching. Morning stiffness lasts approximately 10 minutes then eases."
      }
    },
